- **Step 1 (Virtual Sensor):** N/A (Standard CNN-LSTM from earlier analysis).
- **Step 2 (Thermal State):** *Zhao et al. 2024 (J.Energy Storage)*, *Wang et al. 2024 (IEEE TII)*, *Zhou et al. 2024 (IEEE TTE)* — Spatial/PDE/Graph reconstruction.
