## P. Final Thermal Platform Understanding
The ECUlytics Thermal Intelligence Platform is a tiered analytical pipeline. The **Virtual Sensor** (Step 1) acts as a mathematical proxy to infer missing data. The **State Estimator** (Step 2) stitches physical and virtual data into a cohesive thermodynamic map using physics-informed spatial graphs. The **Intelligence Engines** (Step 3) are specialized, independent algorithms that look for specific fault signatures (hotspots, dying sensors, failing pumps, rising risks) within that map. Finally, the **Decision Engine** (Step 4) translates these complex fault signatures into safe, advisory, human-readable instructions without taking autonomous control of the vehicle. Development must build these layers sequentially, from the inside out.
